OL,3,AMan charged over Manchester synagogue
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith the Manchester synagogue attack in
OL,8,Fwhich two men were killed.
OL,10,FCounter terrorism police said Hekmat
OL,11,FOmar Ali Hakim, 49, of St James Road,
OL,12,FHigher Broughton, Salford, had been
OL,13,Fcharged with failing to disclose
OL,14,Finformation regarding terrorist
OL,15,Factivity.
OL,17,FHakim has been remanded into custody to
OL,18,Fappear before Westminster Magistrates'
OL,19,FCourt on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
