OL,3,AMan charged over Manchester synagogue
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have so far been eight arrests in
OL,7,Fconnection with the attack, however
OL,8,Fthis is the first charge that "relates
OL,9,Fdirectly" to the morning of 2 October,
OL,10,Fwhen two men died as the Heaton Park
OL,11,FHebrew Congregation synagogue was
OL,12,Fattacked by Jihad Al-Shamie. He was
OL,13,Fshot by police and died at the scene.
